（臭蒿）"}]},{"ID":"20240822171651-ayn025k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822171651-ayn025k","updated":"20240822171848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 572px;","style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿 7-20240822171544-sq3i7o9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\" parent-style=\"width: 572px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 583px;","style":"width: 573px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿 4-20240822171338-0xf1s5e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 573px;\" parent-style=\"width: 583px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822171651-m4t6ni9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822171651-m4t6ni9","updated":"20240822171846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 497px;","style":"width: 487px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿 5-20240822171422-7nak27m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 487px;\" parent-style=\"width: 497px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 525px;","style":"width: 515px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿-20240822170900-4j5w4z4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 515px;\" parent-style=\"width: 525px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822171651-qnsl6ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822171651-qnsl6ls","updated":"20240822171849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 476px;","style":"width: 466px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿 1-20240822170931-9o0l7xy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 466px;\" parent-style=\"width: 476px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 535px;","style":"width: 525px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿 6-20240822171508-1buag7j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 525px;\" parent-style=\"width: 535px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822171651-r8ow6ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822171651-r8ow6ho","updated":"20240822171851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 576px;","style":"width: 566px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿 3-20240822171247-rrfah6f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 566px;\" parent-style=\"width: 576px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 576px;","style":"width: 566px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄花蒿 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄花蒿 2-20240822171133-ehuxhj2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 566px;\" parent-style=\"width: 576px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822170034-fx6n7qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822170034-fx6n7qi","updated":"20240822170620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：据说古时青蒿和黄花蒿都被称为青蒿，后来才被人分开来区别；黄蒿色偏黄，散发臭味，青蒿色发青偏黑色，草味浓无臭味；（屠呦呦的青蒿素是从黄花蒿内提取出来的，并不是提取自青蒿，因为青蒿无青蒿素）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184814-a58y48d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184814-a58y48d"}},{"ID":"20240612185139-jf8pkuk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185139-jf8pkuk","updated":"20240612185145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185139-antlaly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185139-antlaly","updated":"20240612185139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185139-g6naalw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185139-g6naalw","updated":"20240612185139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主疥搔，痂痒，恶创，杀虫，留热在骨节间。明目。一名青蒿，一名方溃。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185139-0417txd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185139-0417txd","updated":"20240612185139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生华阴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185139-37d3y11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185139-37d3y11","updated":"20240612185139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蒿，菣也，菣，香蒿也，或作（上艹下坚）。《尔雅》云：蒿菣。郭璞云：今人呼青蒿香中炙啖者为菣，《史记·司马相如传》，庵（上艹下闾）。注《汉书音义》曰：庵（上艹下闾），蒿也。陶宏景云：即今青蒿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185147-0ve74iy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612185147-0ve74iy"}},{"ID":"20240612185156-uppi3xt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185156-uppi3xt","updated":"20240612185203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185156-4j6tjnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185156-4j6tjnc","updated":"20240612185156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今青蒿也，在处有之，得春最早，人剔以为蔬，根赤叶香。今人谓之青蒿，亦有所别也。但一类之中，又取其青者。陕西、绥、银之间有青蒿。在蒿丛之间，时有一两窠，迥然青色，土人谓之为香蒿。茎叶与常蒿一同，但常蒿色淡青，此蒿色深青。犹青，故气芬芳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185156-v5o1yzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185156-v5o1yzu","updated":"20240612185156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恐古人所用以深青者为胜，不然诸蒿何尝不青？"}]},{"ID":"20240612185301-m6ye6zo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612185301-m6ye6zo"}},{"ID":"20240612185302-hi4wr2d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185302-hi4wr2d","updated":"20240612185307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185302-16vi0k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185302-16vi0k0","updated":"20240612185302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（即青蒿。） 味苦，气寒。无毒。山谷川泽，随处有生。叶实根茎并堪入药，春夏采用茎叶为宜。入童便熬膏，退骨蒸劳热。生捣烂绞汁，却心痛热黄。息肉肿痈，烧灰淋浓汤点；泄痢鬼气，研末调米饮吞。秋冬用之，取根与实。实须炒过，根乃咀成。愈风疹疥瘙，止虚烦盗汗。开胃明目，辟邪杀虫。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即蓬蒿别名，（似青蒿而叶粗，上有白毛错涩。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612185302-7alcw8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185302-7alcw8k","updated":"20240612185302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补功；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"邪蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"似青蒿细软，利肠胃，通血脉，续不足有功。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185302-z4dn2nz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185302-z4dn2nz","updated":"20240612185302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶疮。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比小蓟略殊，下气破血。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茼蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与黄菊近似，安心养脾。又"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"马先蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，类茺蔚叶。俗呼虎麻茺蔚，（谟）按∶谚云∶三月茵陈四月蒿，人每诵之。只疑两药一种，因分老嫩而异名也。殊不知叶虽近似，种却不同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185302-9t8bukr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185302-9t8bukr","updated":"20240612185302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿叶背面俱青，且结花实；茵陈叶面青背白，花实全无。况遇寒冬不凋，至春复旧干上发叶，因干陈老，故名茵陈。草蒿茎干俱凋，至三月可采，产新苗者四月才成。是指采从先后为云，非以苗分老嫩为说也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185250-by4k222","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612185250-by4k222"}},{"ID":"20240612185251-7h3z3py","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185251-7h3z3py","updated":"20240612185256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185251-lbxc3yz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185251-lbxc3yz","updated":"20240612185251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿寒苦祛痨热，能止痢泄与汗血，开胃补中和心腹，金疮恶疥痛可劫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185251-jh8eul4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185251-jh8eul4","updated":"20240612185251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蒿，高也，至秋而高即青蒿，可杂香菜食之。无毒。主骨蒸劳热，冷热久痢，泄泻盗汗最妙。开胃明目，补中益气，驻颜色，黑毛发。止心痛热黄，及鬼气尸疰伏连妇人血气、腹内满。疗恶疮疥癣，风疹杀虫。生捣敷金疮，止血生肉止痛。烧灰淋汁，和锻石煎膏，去恶肉。根茎子叶并入药，四者慎勿同用，若同用成痼疾。春夏采苗，秋冬采子，以童便浸七日夜，取出晒干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185230-fy3u8gn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612185230-fy3u8gn"}},{"ID":"20240612185231-o4h8eoy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185231-o4h8eoy","updated":"20240612185242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185231-yo1k5aq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185231-yo1k5aq","updated":"20240612185236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿，即青蒿也。生华阴川泽，今处处有之。春生苗，叶极细，嫩时人亦取杂诸香菜食之，至夏高三、五尺；秋后开细淡黄花，花下便结子，如粟米大，八、九月间采子，阴干。根、茎、子、叶并入药用，干者炙作饮香，尤佳。青蒿亦名方溃。凡使子勿使叶，使根勿使茎，四者若同，反以成疾。得童子小便浸之良。治骨蒸热劳为最，古方多单用者。葛氏治金刃初伤，取生青蒿，捣，傅上，以帛裹创，血止即愈。崔元亮《海上方》，疗骨蒸鬼气，取童子小便五大斗，澄过，青蒿五斗，八、九月采带子者最好，细锉，二物相和，内好大釜中，以猛火煎取三大斗，去滓，净洗釜令干，再泻汁，安釜中，以微火煎可二大斗，即取猪胆十枚相和，煎一大斗半，除火，待冷，以新瓷器盛，每欲服时，取甘草二、三两，熟炙，捣末，以煎和捣一千杵为丸。空腹，粥饮下二十丸，渐增至三十丸止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185216-6c226bw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612185216-6c226bw"}},{"ID":"20240612185217-qyvq12x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185217-qyvq12x","updated":"20240612185225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185217-i0hvz0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185217-i0hvz0e","updated":"20240612185217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主疥瘙痂痒，恶疮，杀虱，留热在骨节间，明目。《唐本》注∶生敷金疮，大止血，生肉，止疼痛良。陈脏器∶主鬼气尸疰伏连，妇人血气，腹内满及冷热久为驻颜亦用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185217-haxas3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185217-haxas3m","updated":"20240612185217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"癣、风疹，杀虱，煎洗。又云∶臭蒿子，凉，无毒。治劳，下气，开胃，止盗汗及邪气鬼毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185217-boc6fzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185217-boc6fzr","updated":"20240612185217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名治之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184814-byrx1bn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184814-byrx1bn"}},{"ID":"20240612185128-2wu3eln","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185128-2wu3eln","updated":"20240612185133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185128-6y0dazz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185128-6y0dazz","updated":"20240612185128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主治疥瘙痂痒，恶疮，杀虱，留热在骨节间，明目。一名青蒿，一名方溃。生华阴川泽。处处有之，即今青蒿，人亦取杂香菜食之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184814-f9p2ss3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184814-f9p2ss3"}},{"ID":"20240612185118-phx4may","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185118-phx4may","updated":"20240612185122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185118-q626e0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185118-q626e0y","updated":"20240612185118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主疥瘙痂痒恶疮，杀虱，留热在骨节间，明目。一名青蒿，一名方溃。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185118-z85m3qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185118-z85m3qe","updated":"20240612185118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生华阴川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184814-k9xh0ft","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184814-k9xh0ft"}},{"ID":"20240612185108-l8iih4d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185108-l8iih4d","updated":"20240612185113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185108-854ut2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185108-854ut2z","updated":"20240612185108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。主疥搔痂痒。恶创。杀虱留热在骨间。明目。一名青蒿。一名方溃。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185108-cg0jkvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185108-cg0jkvw","updated":"20240612185108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气早春阳。三秋余力。松桧香邻。蓬藜群植。美咏鹿鸣。臭含息。庚伏元辰。悬庭充食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185108-oh7e19q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185108-oh7e19q","updated":"20240612185108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李时珍曰。青蒿得春木少阳之气最早。梦溪笔谈。此蒿深青如松桧之色。深秋余蒿并黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185108-q8cu4t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185108-q8cu4t9","updated":"20240612185108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此蒿犹青。礼藜莠蓬蒿并兴。诗。呦呦鹿鸣。食野之蒿。韩保升曰。其气息似臭。故名蒿。月令通纂。伏内庚日。采青蒿悬于门庭辟邪。冬至元旦为末服。亦良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184822-794u6lq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184822-794u6lq"}},{"ID":"20240612185058-e1bsfuv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185058-e1bsfuv","updated":"20240612185103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185058-pbatb3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185058-pbatb3h","updated":"20240612185058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，唯中为妙，到膝即仰，到腰即俯。使子，勿使叶；使根，勿使茎；四件若同使，翻然成痼疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185058-e7ptuil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185058-e7ptuil","updated":"20240612185058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡采得叶，不计多少，用七岁儿童七个溺，浸七日七夜后，漉出，晒干用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184822-rxuu6zy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184822-rxuu6zy"}},{"ID":"20240612185022-2ro6f46","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-2ro6f46","updated":"20240612185030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"草蒿《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612185022-3e0jvf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-3e0jvf7","updated":"20240612185022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主疥瘙痂痒恶疮，杀虱，留热在骨节间，明目。一名青蒿，一名方溃。生华阴川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185022-hj0gotp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-hj0gotp","updated":"20240612185022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶处处有之。即今青蒿，人亦取杂香菜食之。唐本注云∶此蒿生挪敷金疮，大止血生肉，止疼痛，良。今按陈藏器本草∶蒿主鬼气尸疰伏连，妇人血气，腹内满及冷热久痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185022-qom1hvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-qom1hvp","updated":"20240612185022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋冬用子，春夏用苗，并捣绞汁服。亦曝干为末，小便中服。如觉冷，用酒煮。又烧为灰，纸八、九重淋取汁，和锻石去息肉、 子。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶叶似茵陈蒿而背不白，高四尺许。四月、五月采苗，日干。江东人呼为 蒿，为其臭似 ，北人呼为青蒿。尔雅云∶蒿， 。释曰∶蒿一名 。《诗·小雅》云∶食野之蒿。陆机云∶青蒿也。荆、豫之间，汝南、汝阴皆云 。孙炎云∶荆楚之间谓蒿为 。郭云∶今人呼青蒿香中炙啖者为 ，是也。日华子云∶青蒿，补中益气，轻身补劳，驻颜色，长毛发，发黑不老。兼去蒜发，心痛，热黄。生捣汁服并敷之，泻痢。饭饮调末五钱匕，烧灰和锻石煎，治恶毒疮并茎亦用。又云子味甘，冷，无毒。明目，开胃。炒用治劳，壮健人。小便浸用治恶疥癣风疹，杀虱煎洗。又云臭蒿子，凉，无毒。治劳，下气开胃，止盗汗及邪气鬼毒。又名草蒿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185022-o1p7sqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-o1p7sqp","updated":"20240612185022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶草蒿，即青蒿也。生华阴川泽，今处处有之。春生苗，叶极细嫩，时人亦取杂诸香菜食之。至夏高三、五尺。秋后开细淡黄花，花下便结子，如粟米大，八、九月间采子，阴干。根、茎、子、叶并入药用，干者炙作饮香尤佳。青蒿亦名方溃。凡使子勿使叶，使根勿使茎，四者若同，反以成疾。得童子小便浸之，良。治骨蒸热劳为最。古方多单用者。葛氏治金刃初伤。取生青蒿捣敷上，以帛裹创血止即愈。崔元亮《海上方》∶疗骨蒸鬼气。取童子小便五大斗澄过，青蒿五斗，八、九月拣带子者最好，细锉，二物相和，纳好大釜中，以猛火煎，取三大斗去滓，净洗釜令干，再泻汁安釜中，以微火煎，可二大斗，即取猪胆十枚相和，煎一大斗半，除火待冷，以新瓷器盛。每欲服时，取甘草二、三两熟炙，捣末，以煎和捣一千杵为丸，空腹粥饮下二十丸，渐增至三十丸止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185022-mpbda7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-mpbda7h","updated":"20240612185022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，唯中为妙，到膝即仰，到腰即俯。使子勿使叶，使根勿使茎，四件若同使，翻然成痼疾。采得叶不计多少，用七岁儿童七个溺浸七日七夜后，漉出，晒干用之。食疗云∶青蒿，寒。益气长发，能轻身补中，不老明目，煞风毒。捣敷疮上，止血生肉。最早，春便生，色白者是。自然香醋淹为菹，益人。治骨蒸，以小便渍一、两宿，干，末为丸，甚去热劳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185022-f7e0e7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-f7e0e7l","updated":"20240612185022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又，鬼气，取子为末，酒服之方寸匕。瘥。烧灰淋汁，和锻石煎，治恶疮瘢靥。百一方∶治蜂螫人。嚼青蒿敷疮上，即瘥。斗门方治丈夫、妇人劳瘦。青蒿细锉，水三斗，童子小便五升同煎，取二升半去滓，入器中煎成膏，丸如梧桐子大，空心，临卧以温酒吞下二十丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612185022-xz4w3m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612185022-xz4w3m7","updated":"20240612185022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶草蒿，今青蒿也。在处有之，得春最早，人剔以为蔬，根赤叶香。今人谓之青蒿，亦有所别也。但一类之中，又取其青色者。陕西、绥、银之间有青蒿。在蒿丛之间，时有一、两棵，迥然青色，土人谓之为香蒿。茎、叶与常蒿一同，但常蒿色淡青，此蒿色深青，犹青，故气芬芳。恐古人所用以深青者为胜，不然，诸蒿何尝不青。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184822-lnrwv25","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184822-lnrwv25"}},{"ID":"20240612184823-2atdm1a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-2atdm1a","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：青蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-fm9mp1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-fm9mp1x","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-w9umdxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-w9umdxa","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qīnɡ Hāo"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-m9tichu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-m9tichu","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-9vxphz5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-9vxphz5","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蒿子、臭蒿、香蒿、苦蒿、臭青蒿、香青蒿、细叶蒿、细青蒿、草青蒿、草蒿子"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-8jme7y4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-8jme7y4","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-6059pnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-6059pnm","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" HERBA ARTEMISIAE ANNUAE"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hgu81o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hgu81o4","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-g2wa4n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-g2wa4n2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄花蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Artemisia annua L.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地上部分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季花盛开时采割，除去老茎，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-klyrydu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-klyrydu","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-0s37dmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-0s37dmw","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品茎呈圆柱形，上部多分枝，长30～80cm，直径0.2～0.6cm；表面黄绿色或棕黄色，具纵棱线；质略硬，易折断，断面中部有髓。叶互生，暗绿色或棕绿色，卷缩易碎，完整者展平后为三回羽状深裂，裂片及小裂片矩圆形或长椭圆形，两面被短毛。气香特异，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-yfltqi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-yfltqi4","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-9bjojxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-9bjojxd","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-u9u42y8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-u9u42y8","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-rrbu58n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-rrbu58n","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除去杂质，喷淋清水，稍润，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-sejafxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-sejafxw","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-kjufw9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-kjufw9u","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品粉末3g，加石油醚（60～90℃）50ml，加热回流1 小时，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加正己烷30ml使溶解，用20％乙腈溶液提取3 次，每次10ml，合并乙腈液，蒸干，残渣加乙醇0。5ml 使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取青蒿素对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含1mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各5μl，分别点于同一硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以石油醚（60～90℃）－乙醚（3:2） 为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以10％硫酸乙醇溶液，在105℃ 加热至斑点显色清晰，置紫外光灯（365nm） 下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-zjj1sp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-zjj1sp1","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-0le3wnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-0le3wnw","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、胆经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-v3ucr5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-v3ucr5e","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-m4z8xsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-m4z8xsh","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hnekf7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hnekf7k","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-fr2rkbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-fr2rkbx","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解暑，除蒸，截疟。用于暑邪发热，阴虚发热，夜热早凉，骨蒸劳热，疟疾寒热，湿热黄疸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-6npnijo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-6npnijo","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-lb4y0z5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-lb4y0z5","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6～12g，入煎剂宜后下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-rlvs0cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-rlvs0cp","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-ict8tz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-ict8tz2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）常与藿香、佩兰、滑石等用于外感暑热；和黄芩、半夏、竹茹等用于温热病寒热往来及疟疾等症。用于阴虚发热或原因不明的低热，常和秦艽、鳖甲、地骨皮等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-0tug8qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-0tug8qm","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-5p75brn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-5p75brn","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-vz4h89o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-vz4h89o","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：青蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-ne20oo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-ne20oo8","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-p6mm0ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-p6mm0ry","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qīnɡ Hāo"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-a2psv67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-a2psv67","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-bpu09bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-bpu09bp","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蒿（《诗经》），荍（《毛诗传》），草蒿、方渍（《本经》），三庚草（《履巉岩本草》），野兰蒿（《现代实用中药》），黑蒿（《山东中药》），白染艮（《闽东本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-yuv29d2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-yuv29d2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-iyn8w2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-iyn8w2x","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-pmt7717","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-pmt7717","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-c2jw7p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-c2jw7p2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"青蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄花蒿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏季开花前，选茎叶色青者，割取地上部分，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-4zdmw4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-4zdmw4u","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-tkpegm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-tkpegm8","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国大部分地区均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-u7ervi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-u7ervi2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hw7morz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hw7morz","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①青蒿，又名：香蒿（《说文》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-ulr88gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-ulr88gt","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生或二年生草本，高30～150厘米，全体平滑无毛。茎圆柱形，幼时青绿色，表面有细纵槽，下部稍木质化，上部叶腋间有分枝。叶互生；2回羽状全裂，第1回裂片椭圆形，第2回裂片线形，全缘，或每边1～3羽状浅裂，先端尖，质柔，两面平滑无毛，青绿色。头状花序排列成总状圆锥花序，每一头状花序侧生，稍下垂，直径约6毫米；总苞半球形，苞片3～4层，外层的苞片狭长，内层的卵圆形，边缘膜质；花托外围着生管状雌花，内仅雌蕊1枚，柱头2裂；内部多为两性花，绿黄色，花冠管状，雄蕊5枚，花丝细短，雌蕊1枚，花柱丝状，柱头2裂，呈叉状。瘦果矩圆形至椭圆形，微小，褐色。花期6～7月。果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-y19pddk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-y19pddk","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生长于河岸、砂地及海边。分布辽宁、河北、山东、山西、陕西、江苏，安徽、江西、湖北、浙江、福建、广东等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-tis9t8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-tis9t8c","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②黄花蒿，详\"黄花蒿\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-4n4dzo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-4n4dzo7","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上植物的根（青蒿根）、果实（青蒿子）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-zydbmdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-zydbmdw","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-vraz4k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-vraz4k1","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①青蒿的干燥全草，长约60～90厘米。茎圆柱形，表面黄绿色或绿褐色，有纵向的沟纹及棱线，全体无毛，质轻，易折断，断面呈纤维状，黄白色，中央有白色疏松的髓。叶片部分脱落，残存的叶皱缩卷曲，绿褐色，质脆易碎。气香，味微苦。以质嫩、色绿、气清香者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-7mzmium","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-7mzmium","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②黄花蒿的干燥全草详\"黄花蒿\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-q8j7n7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-q8j7n7b","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-nxj5u8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-nxj5u8r","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 青蒿含有苦味质、挥发油和青蒿碱、维生素A。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-f928hrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-f928hrv","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-rguv0tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-rguv0tu","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 青蒿水浸剂（1：3）在试管内对某些皮肤真菌有些抑制作用。其乙醇提取物在试管内对钩端螺旋体的抗菌浓度为7.8毫克／毫升，效力与连翘、黄柏、蚤休相似，而弱于黄连、荔枝草、黄芩与金银花。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hxr1xul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hxr1xul","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-rfxhmam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-rfxhmam","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 青蒿：拣去杂质，除去残根，水淋使润，切段，晒干。鳖血青蒿：取青蒿段，置大盆内，淋入用温水少许稀释的鳖血，拌匀，稍闷，待鳖血吸收后，入锅内文火微炒，取出，晾干。（每青蒿段100斤，用活鳖200个取血）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-ho5grp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-ho5grp1","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-iykqy89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-iykqy89","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、胆经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-z8hutyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-z8hutyt","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《滇南本草》：\"入脾、胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-9vsq8nm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-9vsq8nm","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"少阳、厥阴血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hjsuiub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hjsuiub","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草新编》：\"入胄、肝、心、肾四经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-gyuqd8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-gyuqd8z","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-goqxw6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-goqxw6u","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦微辛，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-9sody4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-9sody4c","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-mv2q3yb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-mv2q3yb","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草正》：\"味苦微辛，性寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-fnaxapw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-fnaxapw","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求寡》：\"味甘微辛，气寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-c66tnz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-c66tnz2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-zjtl9os","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-zjtl9os","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"产后血虚，内寒作泻，及饮食停滞泄泻者，勿用。凡产后脾胃薄弱，忌与当归、地黄同用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-2yy1a3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-2yy1a3d","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草通玄》：\"胃虚者，不敢投也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-oi7ny9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-oi7ny9o","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-adyc6pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-adyc6pa","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，解暑，除蒸。治温病，暑热，骨蒸劳热，疟疾，痢疾，黄疸，疥疮，瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-k2gzh2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-k2gzh2n","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主疥瘙痂痒，恶疮，杀虱，留热在骨节间，明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hqdtqyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hqdtqyq","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《唐本草》：\"生按敷金疮，大止血，生肉，止疼痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-k0rrar2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-k0rrar2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《食疗本草》：\"益气，长发，补中，明目，煞风毒。治骨蒸。烧灰淋汁，和石灰煎，治恶疮瘢靥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-gos2bir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-gos2bir","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"主妇人血气，腹内满，及冷热久痢。秋冬用子，春夏用苗，并捣绞汁朋。亦暴干为末，小便冲服。如觉冷，用酒煮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-d2pg3ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-d2pg3ek","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"长毛发，发黑不老，兼去蒜发，心痛热黄，生捣汁服并敷之。泻痢，饭饮调末五钱匕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-m5rwdng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-m5rwdng","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《滇南本草》：\"去湿热，消痰。治痰火嘈杂眩晕。利小便，凉血，止大肠风热下血，退五种劳热，发烧怕冷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-m475q4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-m475q4j","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《纲目》：\"治疟疾寒热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-epbdsjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-epbdsjf","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《本草新编》：\"退暑热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-igz42ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-igz42ik","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《生草药性备要》：\"治小儿食积，洗疥癞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-w8gk3ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-w8gk3ph","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩《医林纂要》：\"清血中湿热，治黄疸及郁火不舒之证。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-yz3bcpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-yz3bcpw","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-n65bqc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-n65bqc3","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或入丸、散。外用：捣敷或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-t63fhwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-t63fhwq","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-8tujez6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-8tujez6","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治温病夜热早凉，热退无汗，热自阴来者：青蒿二钱，鳖甲五钱，细生地四钱，知母二钱，丹皮三钱。水五杯，煮取二杯，日再服。（《温病条辨》青蒿鳖甲汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-93cqh97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-93cqh97","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治少阳三焦湿遏热郁，气机不畅，胸痞作呕，寒热如疟者：青蒿脑钱半至二钱，淡竹茹三钱，仙半夏钱半，赤茯苓三钱，青子芩钱半至三钱，生枳壳钱半，陈广皮钱半，碧玉散（包）三钱。水煎服。（《通俗伤寒论》蒿芩清胆汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-drune5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-drune5a","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治骨蒸劳，体瘦、发渴、寒热：青蒿一斤（取叶曝干，捣罗为末），桃仁一斤（酒浸，去皮尖，麸炒令黄.研烂），甘草半（五）两（生捣罗为末）。另以童子小便三斗，于瓷瓮中盛，于糠火上煎令如稀饧，却倾于铜器中，下诸药，又于糠火上煎，以柳木篦搅之，看稀稠得所，候可丸，即丸如梧桐子大，以粗疏布袋盛。每日空心温童子小便下三十丸，日晚再服。（《圣惠方》青蒿圆）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-h8qpcc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-h8qpcc1","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治劳瘦：青蒿（细锉）嫩者一升，以水三升，童子小便五升，同煎成膏，丸如梧桐子大。每服十丸，温酒下，不以时。（《鸡峰普济方》青蒿煎）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-r6sdyff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-r6sdyff","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治虚劳，盗汗、烦热、口干：青蒿一斤，取汁熬膏，入人参末、麦冬末各一两，熬至可丸，丸如梧桐子大。每食后米饮下二十丸。（《圣济总录》青蒿丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-q1ezaaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-q1ezaaq","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治疟疾寒热：青蒿一握，以水二升渍，绞取汁，尽服之。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-8am9b06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-8am9b06","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治虚劳久疟：青蒿捣汁，煎过，如常酿酒饮。（《纲目》青蒿酒）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-yxkf2qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-yxkf2qx","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治温疟痰甚，但热不寒：青蒿二两（童子小便浸焙），黄丹半两。为末。每服二钱，白汤调下。（《仁存堂经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-fc1kcsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-fc1kcsj","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治少阳疟疾，暮热早凉，汗解渴饮，脉左弦，偏于热重者：青蒿三钱，知母二钱，桑叶二钱，鳖甲五钱，丹皮二钱，花粉二钱。水五杯，煮取二杯。疟来前，分二次温服。（《温病条辨》青蒿鳖甲汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-u1pq87s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-u1pq87s","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治赤白痢下：青蒿、艾叶等分。同豆豉捣作饼，日干。每用一饼，以水一盏半煎服。（《圣济总录》蒿豉丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-2fcayy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-2fcayy9","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治暑毒热痢：青蒿叶一两，甘草一钱。水煎服。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-2mdalbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-2mdalbt","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治阑尾炎、胃痛：青蒿、毕拨等量。先将青蒿焙黄，共捣成细末。早、午、晚饭前白开水冲服，每次二克。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-5fejqj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-5fejqj1","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治酒痔便血：青蒿（用叶不用茎，用茎不用叶）为末，粪前（便血用）冷水、粪后（便血用）水酒调服。（《永类钤方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-n56ye5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-n56ye5s","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治鼻中衄血：青蒿捣汁服之，并塞鼻中。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-28c3ab8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-28c3ab8","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治聤耳脓血出不止：青蒿捣末，绵裹纳耳中。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-92o3cad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-92o3cad","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治牙齿肿痛：青蒿一握，煎水漱之。（《济急仙方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-qsktwsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-qsktwsy","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治蜂螯人：青蒿捣敷之。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-giilb4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-giilb4r","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治金疮扑损：㈠青蒿捣封之。㈡青蒿、麻叶、石灰等分。捣和晒干，临时为末搽之。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-qd0bs2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-qd0bs2w","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-vv8uq9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-vv8uq9k","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草新编》：\"青蒿，专解骨蒸劳热，尤能泄暑热之火，泄火热而不耗气血，用之以佐气血之药，大建奇功，可君可臣，而又可佐可使，无不宜也。但必须多用，因其体既轻，而性兼补阴，少用转不得力。又青蒿之退阴火，退骨中之火也，然不独退骨中之火，即肌肤之火，未尝不共泻之也，故阴虚而又感邪者，最宜用耳。又青蒿最宜沙参、地骨皮共享，则泻阴火更捷，青蒿能引骨中之火，行于肌表，而沙参、地骨皮只能凉骨中之火，而不能外泄也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-z9xxbv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-z9xxbv5","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"青蒿亦有两种，一种发于早春，叶青如绵茵陈，专泻丙丁之火，能利水道，与绵茵陈之性不甚相远；一种盛于夏秋，微黄似地肤子，为少阳、厥阴血分之药，茎紫者为良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-2d5ou5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-2d5ou5d","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《重庆堂随笔》：\"青蒿，专解湿热，而气芳香，故为湿温疫疠要药。又清肝、胆血分之伏热，故为女子淋带、小儿痉痢疳匿神剂，《本草》未言，特为发之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-4tvew91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-4tvew91","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-3hfcegn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-3hfcegn","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 此外，部分地区习惯作青蒿使用的，尚有下列几种："}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-thb55hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-thb55hi","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①茵陈蒿及滨蒿的老枝，前者使用于河北、山东、江苏、福建、广东、广西、湖南、湖北等地；后者使用于东北地区。参见\"茵陈蒿\"条."}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-u3j9hbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-u3j9hbr","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②牡蒿的全草，在江苏、上海、四川等地使用。参见\"牡蒿\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-djr05zh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-djr05zh","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-c4m3lps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-c4m3lps","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-v4xwmpu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-v4xwmpu","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：青蒿"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-26i4q6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-26i4q6a","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-ch85c43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-ch85c43","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qīnɡ Hāo"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-7c5c6iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-7c5c6iw","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-kgom35p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-kgom35p","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蒿、草蒿、方溃、（犭凡）蒿、臭蒿、香蒿、三庚草、蒿子、草青蒿、草蒿子、细叶蒿、香青蒿、苦蒿、臭青蒿、香丝草、酒饼草"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-9wpsmck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-9wpsmck","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-amejhyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-amejhyg","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Sweet Wormwood Herb，Herb of Sweet Wormwood"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-p06hrpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-p06hrpa","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-txon96s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-txon96s","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-8clt60n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-8clt60n","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.陶弘景：草蒿，处处有之，即今青蒿，人亦取杂香菜食之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-vyjy9ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-vyjy9ku","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《蜀本草》：《图经》云，青蒿叶似茵陈蒿而背不白，高四尺许，四月、五月采苗，日干，江东人呼为卂蒿，为其臭似卂北人呼为青蒿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-lshrivj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-lshrivj","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草图经》：青蒿，今处处有之。春生苗叶，至夏高三、五尺，秋后开细淡黄花，花下便结子，如粟米大，八、九月间采子，阴干。根、茎、子、叶并入药用，干者炙作饮香尤佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-81qyebz","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-81qyebz","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612184823-l3ea2nb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-l3ea2nb","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612184823-et73r52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-et73r52","updated":"20240612184823"}}]}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-2er3n0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-2er3n0f","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-llsjdcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-llsjdcs","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为菊科植物黄花蒿的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-maz6dzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-maz6dzc","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Artemisia annua L."}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-vi0n2xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-vi0n2xd","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：花苗期采收，切碎，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-l3gr1ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-l3gr1ly","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-wwz11v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-wwz11v4","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于旷野、山坡、路边、河岸等处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-usl43r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-usl43r7","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于我国南北各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-th95a2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-th95a2m","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-cyhpcnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-cyhpcnx","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黄花蒿 一年生草本，高40-150cm。全株具较强挥发油气味。茎直立，具纵条纹，多分枝，光滑无毛。基生叶平铺地面，开花时凋谢；茎生叶互生，幼时绿色，老时变为黄褐色，无毛，有短柄，向上渐无柄；叶片通常为三回羽状全裂，裂片短细，有极小粉末状短柔毛，上面深绿色，下面淡绿色，具细小的毛或粉末状腺状玟点；叶轴两侧具窄翅；茎上部的叶向下膛渐细小呈条形。头关花序细小，球形，径约2mm，具细软短梗，多数组成圆锥状；总苞小，于状，花全为管状花，黄色，外围为雌花，中央为两性花。瘦果椭圆形。花期8-10月，果期10-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-mopd8xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-mopd8xq","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-l499ygt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-l499ygt","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜温暖湿润气候，不耐阴蔽，忌涝。种子发芽温度8-25℃。愉阳光充足，疏松肥沃，富含腐殖质，排水良好的砂质壤土栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-theyr2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-theyr2q","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用种子和分株繁殖。种子繁殖：分枝播法和育苗移栽法。直播法，于3-4月将种子与细沙混合后，按行株距30cm×20cm开穴播种。育苗移栽法，于2月育苗，撒播，苗高10-20cm时移栽。但费工多，生产上较少应用。分株繁殖：3-4月挖掘老株，分株移栽，每穴1-2株，覆土压实，浇水。赤可用自繁方法。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-s6p1c5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-s6p1c5w","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 幼苗期要及时除草，施稀人粪尿，采收嫩销后，加强田间管理。一般每年中耕除草2-3次，并结合施人粪尿2-3次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-ie9haft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-ie9haft","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治 病害有菌核病、根腐病。虫害有蚜虫、蚂蚁、地老虎等为害。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-yqrayal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-yqrayal","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-03p5vbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-03p5vbf","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 茎圆柱形，上部多分枝，长30-80cm，直径0.2-0.6cm，表面黄绿色或棕黄色，具纵棱线；质略硬，易折断，断面中部有髓。叶互生，暗绿色或棕绿色，卷缩，碎，完整者展平后为三回羽状深裂，裂片及小裂片矩圆形或长椭圆形，两面被短毛。气香特异，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-8lnc4k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-8lnc4k2","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以色绿、叶多、香气浓者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-yila3wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-yila3wf","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 叶片表面观：上下表皮细胞形状不规则，垂周壁波状弯曲，长径18-41（-80）μm，脉脊上的表皮细胞呈窄长方形。气孔椭圆形，不定式。表面布满非腺毛和腺毛。非腺毛于中脉附近多风，为T字形毛，壁细胞横向延伸或在柄处折成V字形，长240-480（-816）μm，柄由3-8细胞组成，单列，基部柄细胞较大，壁细胞常脱落。腺毛椭圆形，无柄，两个半圆形分泌细胞相对排列，常充满淡黄色挥发油。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-bfedj49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-bfedj49","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-c9tnaar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-c9tnaar","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 青蒿素的急性和亚急性毒性：小鼠灌胃青蒿素LD50为4223mg／kg，治疗指数47.1，安全系数为13.7。采用猫、犬、家兔、豚鼠、大鼠、小鼠等动物，青蒿素给药途径有灌胃、肌肉注射、腹腔注射等，剂量为100-1600mg／kg，连续给药3-7天，观察给药前后一般状态、食欲、体重、心血管系统、肝肾功能的变化，以及各主要脏器病理组织学改变。结果当剂量相当于临床用量70倍时，未见犬、猫、兔、豚鼠、大鼠等动物心血管系统、肝肾功能有异常变化，仅小鼠灌胃青蒿素800mg／kg·d组给药后4天出现谷丙转氨酶一过性升高。亚急性毒性观察中，狗、大鼠应用相当临床用量的70倍时，未见脑电、心电、肝功、血象、蛋白总量、蛋白分类、食欲、生长等有异常改变，仅见狗连续用药21天后非蛋白氮较给药前升高，心、肝、肾等主要脏器病理检查仅显示可逆性病变。小鼠畸胎实验，青蒿素不影响正常生育，亦无畸形，诱变性测定结果表明，青蒿素不是诱变剂，无致癌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-bdf3vom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-bdf3vom","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-2xu6r4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-2xu6r4w","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地上部分含萜类：青蒿素（qinghaosu. Artemi-sinin,arteannuin），青蒿素Ⅰ（qinghaosuⅠ，artemisinin A,arteannuin A），青蒿素Ⅱ（qinghaosuⅡ,artemisinin B,arteannuin B），青蒿素Ⅲ即氢化青蒿素，脱氧青蒿素（qinghaosuⅢ，hydroartemisinin,de-oxyartemisinin）[1-3]，青蒿素Ⅳ（qinghaosu Ⅳ），青蒿素Ⅴ（qing-haosu Ⅴ）[4,5]，青蒿素Ⅵ（qinghaosu Ⅵ）[5]，青蒿素B的异构体青蒿素C（artemisinin C,arteannuin C）[5,6]，青蒿互G（arteannuin G）[7]，去氧异青蒿素B（deoxyisoartemisinin B,epideoxyarteannuin B），去氧异青蒿素C（deoxyisoartemisinin C）,青蒿蒿烯（artemisi-tene）[5]，青蒿酸（qinghao acid，artemisic acid,artemisinic acid,arteannuic acid）[8]，去氢青蒿酸（dehydroartemisinic acid）[5,9]，环氧青蒿酸（epoxyartemisinic acid）[10]，11R-左旋二氢青蒿酸（11R-dihydroartemisinic acid）[11]，青蒿酸甲酯（methyl artemisinate），青蒿醇（artemisinol）[2]，去甲黄花蒿酸（norannuic acid）[12]，二氢去氧异青蒿素B（dihydroepideoxyarteannun B）[13]，黄花蒿内酯（an-nulide）[14]，无羁萜（friedelin）及3β-无羁萜醇（friedelan 3β-ol）[15]等；黄酮类；槲皮万寿菊素-6，7，3，4-四甲醚（quercetagetin-6，7，3，4-tetramethylether）[1]，猫眼草酚（chrysosplenol,chrysosplenol D）[4]，蒿黄素（artemetin），3-甲氧基猫眼草酚即猫草黄素（3-methoxychrysosplenol，chrysolplenetin），3，5，3-三羟基-6，7，4-三甲氧基黄酮（3,5,3-trihydroxy-6，7，4-trimethoxyflavone）[6]，5-羟基-3，6，7，4-四甲氧基黄酮（5-hydroxy-3，6，7，4-tetram-ethoxyflavone）[16]，紫花牡荆素（casticin）[17]，中国蓟醇（cirsili-neol），5，3-二羟基-6，7，4-三甲氧基黄酮（penduletin）,5,7,3,4-四羟基-二甲氧基黄酮（axillarin），去甲中国蓟醇（cirsiliol），树柳黄素（tamarixetin），鼠李素（rhamnetin），槲皮素-3-甲醚（quercetin-3-methylether），滨蓟黄素（cirsimaritin），鼠李柠檬素（rhamnoci-trin），金圣草素（chrysoeriol），5，2，4-三羟基-6，7，5-三甲氧基黄酮（5，2，4-trihydroxy-6，2，4-trihydroxy-6，7，5-trimethoxyflavone），5，7，8，3-四羟基-3，4-二甲氧基黄酮（5，7，8，3-tetrahydroxy-3,4-dimethoxyflavone），槲皮万寿菊素-3，4-二甲醚（quercetagetin-3,4-dimethylether）[18]，山柰酚（kaempferol），槲皮素（quercetin），木犀草素（luteolin），万寿菊素（patuletin），槲 皮素芸香糖甙（quercetin-3-rutinoside），木犀草素-7-O-糖甙（luteolin-7-O-glyco-side），山柰酚-3-O-糖甙（kaempferol-3-O-glucpferol-3-O-glucoside），槲皮素-3-O糖甙（quercetin-3-O-glucoside），万寿菊素-3-O-糖甙（patuletin-3-O-glucside）及6-甲氧基山柰酚-3-O-糖甙（6-methoxykaempferol-3-O-glucoside）[19]等；香豆精类；东莨菪素（scopoletin）[1]，香豆粗（coumarin）[3]，6，8-二甲氧基-7-羟基香豆粗（6-8-iemethoxy-7-hydroxycoumarin），5，6-二甲氧基-7-羟基香豆精（5，6-dimethoxy-7-hydroxycoumarin）及蒿属香豆精（scoparon）[18]等；挥发油：其成分有左旋-樟脑（camphor），β-丁香烯（β-caryophellene），异蒿属酮（isoartemisia keton），β-蒎烯（β-pinene）[1]，乙酸乙脑酯（bornyl acetate），1，8-桉叶素（1，8-cineole），香苇醇（carveol，苄基异戊酸）（benzylisovalerate），β-金合欢烯（β-farnesene），（王古）（王巴）类（copaene），γ-衣兰油烯（γ-muurolene）[8]，三环烯（tricyclene），α-蒎烯（α-pinene），小茴香酮（fenchone），蒿属酮（artemisa ketone），芳樟醇（linalool），异龙脑（isolborneol），α-松油醇（α-terpineol），龙脑（bor-neol）[6]，樟烯（camphene），月桂烯（myrcene），柠檬烯（limonene），γ-松油醇（γ-terpineol），异戊酸龙脑酯（bornyl isovalerate），γ-毕澄茄烯（γ-cadinene），ξ-毕澄茄烯，α-榄香烯（α-elemene），β-榄香烯，γ-榄香烯[20]，水杨酸（salicylic acid），β-松油烯（β-terpinene），α-侧柏烯（α-thujene），4-蒈烯（4-terpineol），4-乙酸松油醇酯（4-terpingyl acetate）及乙酸芳樟醇酯（linlayl acetate）[21]等；其他：棕榈酸（palmitic acid）[2]，豆甾醇（stigmasterol），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），石南藤酰胺乙酸酯（aurantiamide acetate）[16]5-十九烷基间苯二酚-3-O-甲醚酯（5-nonadecylresorcinol-3-O-methylether）[13]，二十九醇（nonacosanol），2-甲基三十烷-8-酮-23-醇（2-methyltriacosan-8-one-23-ol），三十烷酸三十一醇酯（hentriacontanyl triaconta-noate），2，29-二甲基三十烷（2，29-dimethyltriacontane）[22]，黄花蒿双五氧化物（annuadiepoxide），本都山蒿环氧化物（ponticae-poxide）[23]及相对分子质量分别为150 000、100 000的β-糖甙酶（β-glucosidase）ⅠⅡ[24]等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-shj67o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-shj67o6","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-ujm76x5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-ujm76x5","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗疟作用：青蒿乙醚提取中性部分和其稀醇浸膏对鼠疟、猴疟和人疟均呈显着抗疟作用。体内试验表明，青蒿素对疟原虫红细胞内期有杀灭作用，而对红细胞外期和红细胞前期无效。青蒿素具有快速抑制原虫成熟的作用。蒿甲醚乳剂的抗疟效果优于还原青蒿素琥珀酸钠水剂，是治疗凶险型疟疾的理想剂型。青蒿琥酯2.5、5、10、15mg／kg，2次/天，连续3天，皮肤外搽，治疗猴疟均有不同程度疗效。5、10mg／kg，2次/天，连续10天，皮肤外搽即可使猴疟转阴。加入适量促透氮酮，可提高抗疟作用。脱羰青蒿素和碳杂脱羰青蒿素对小鼠体内的伯氏疟原虫K173株的ED50和ED90分别为12.6mg／kg和25.8mg／kg。体外试验表明，青蒿素可明显抑制恶性疟原虫无性体的生长，有直接杀伤作用。青蒿素、蒿甲醚和氯喹对恶性疟原虫的IC50分别为75.2，29.4.和43.2nmol／L。青蒿素酯钠对恶性疟原虫6个分离株（包括抗氯喹株）有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-97td5ef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-97td5ef","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗菌作用：青蒿水煎液对表皮葡萄球菌、卡他球菌、炭疽杆菌、白喉杆菌有较强的抑菌作用，对金黄色葡萄球菌、绿脓杆菌、痢疾杆菌、结核秆菌等也有一定的抑制作用。青蒿挥发油在0.25%浓度时，对所有皮肤癣菌有抑菌作用，在1%浓度时，对所有皮肤癣菌有杀菌作用。青蒿素有抗流感病毒的作用。青蒿酯钠对金葡萄、福氏痢疾杆菌、大肠杆菌、卡他球菌，甲型和乙型副伤寒秆菌均有一定的抗菌作用。青蒿中的谷甾醇和豆甾醇亦有抗病毒作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-77qd31d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-77qd31d","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.抗寄生虫作用：青蒿乙醚提取物、稀醇浸膏及青蒿素对鼠疟、猴疟、人疟均呈显着抗疟作用。体外培养提示，青蒿素对疟原虫有直接杀灭作用。电镜观察证明，青蒿素主要作用于疟原虫红细胞内期无性体的膜相结构，首先作用于食物色膜、表膜和线粒体膜，其次是核膜和内质网。此外对核内染色体亦有影响。由于食物泡膜发生变化，阻断了疟原虫摄取营养的早期阶段，使疟原虫迅速发生氨基酸饥饿，形成自噬泡，并不断排出体外，使泡浆大量损失，内部结构瓦解而死亡。青蒿素对间日疟、恶性疟及抗氯喹地区恶性疟均有疗效高、退热及原虫转阴时间快的特点，尤其适于抢救凶险性疟疾，但复燃率高。此外，青蒿尚有抗血吸虫及钩端螺旋体作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-n1rknb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-n1rknb8","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.解热作用：用蒸馏法制备的青蒿注射液，对百、白、破三联疫苗致热的家兔有明显的解热作用。青蒿与金银花组方，利用蒸馏法制备的青银注射液，对伤寒、副伤寒甲、乙三联菌苗致热的家免，有比单味青蒿注射液更为显着的退热效果，其降温特点迅速而持久，优于柴胡和安痛定注射液对照组。金银花与青蒿有协同解热作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-3uz0cpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-3uz0cpm","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.免疫作用：用小鼠足垫试验、淋巴细胞转化试验、兔疫特异玫瑰花试验和溶血空斑试验等4项免疫指标观察青蒿素的免疫作用，发现青蒿素对体液免疫有明显的抑制作用，对细胞免疫有促进作用，可能具有免疫调节作。青蒿素、蒿甲醚有促进脾TS细胞增殖功能。肌肉注射蒿甲醚对Begle大外周血T、B、Tu及Tr淋巴细胞亦有明显抑制作用。亦明显降低正常小鼠血清IgG含量、增加脾脏重量。降低鸡红细胞致敏小鼠血清IgG含量。静脉注射青蒿素50-100mg／kg能显着提高小鼠腹腔巨噬细胞吞噬率（50.2-53.1%）和吞噬指数（1.58-1.91）。青蒿素还可提高淋巴细胞转化率，促进细胞免疫作用。青蒿琥酯可促进Ts细胞增殖，抑制TE细胞产生，阻止白细胞介素及各种炎症介质的释放，从而起到免疫调节作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-8g1a49t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-8g1a49t","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.对心血管系统的作用：兔心灌注表明，青蒿素可减慢心率，抑制心肌收缩力，降低冠脉流量。静脉注射有降血压作用，但不影响去甲肾上腺素的升压反应，认为主要系对心脏的直接抑制所改。静脉注射20mg／kg青蒿素可抗乌头碱所致兔心律失常。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-63574r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-63574r0","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.其它作用：青蒿琥酯能显着缩短小鼠戊巴比妥睡眼时间。青蒿素对实验性矽肺有明显疗效。蒿甲醚对小鼠有辐射防护作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-o75gm0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-o75gm0y","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-n9us1t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-n9us1t3","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.青蒿：拣去杂质，除去残根，水淋使润，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-e5bfh8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-e5bfh8p","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.鳖血青蒿：取青蒿段，置大盆内，淋入用温水少许稀释的鳖血，拌匀，稍闷，待鳖血吸收后，入锅内文火微炒，取出，晾干。（每青蒿段100斤，用活鳖200个取血）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-cqualc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-cqualc7","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-xhkr6xy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-xhkr6xy","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）本品叶的粉末1g，加甲醇50ml浸泡。取甲醇提取液，挥去溶剂，加7%盐酸羟胺的甲醇溶液与10%氢氧化钾的甲醇溶液（1：1）1ml，在水浴中微热；冷却后用10%盐酸调Ph至3-4，加1%三氯化铁的乙醇液1-2滴，即显紫色。（检查内酯类化合物）（2）薄层色谱 取本品粉末3g，加石油醚（60-90℃）ml，加热回流1h，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加正已烷30ml使溶解，用20%乙脯溶提取3次，每次10ml，合并乙脯液，蒸干，残渣加乙醇0.5ml使溶解，作为供主式品溶液。另取青蒿素对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含1mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液，吸取上述两种溶液各5μl，分别点于同一硅胶G苤层板上，以10%硫酸乙醇溶液，105℃加热至斑点显色清晰，置紫外光灯（365nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的荧光屏光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-pa1qe71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-pa1qe71","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-trk67o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-trk67o3","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝；胆经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-gyrvs7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-gyrvs7e","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-q3uc0o9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-q3uc0o9","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；微辛；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-gp8ddkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-gp8ddkv","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-34q8ikf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-34q8ikf","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：产后血虚，内寒作泻，及饮食停滞泄泻者，勿用。凡产后脾胃薄弱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-c58fomb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-c58fomb","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草通玄》：胃虚者，不敢投也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hs9iqmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hs9iqmj","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-fkzm3eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-fkzm3eb","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热；解暑；除蒸；截疟。主暑热；暑湿；湿温；阴虚发热；疟疾；黄疸"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-sdg3vu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-sdg3vu0","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-oe8qk6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-oe8qk6r","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，6-15g，治疟疾可用20-40g，不宜久煎；鲜品用量加倍，水浸绞汁饮；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷；或鲜品捣敷；或煎水洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-druv6hg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-druv6hg","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-fvpop7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-fvpop7v","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草图经》：青蒿，治骨蒸劳热为最，古方多单用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-7ha9p5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-7ha9p5p","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草新编》：青蒿，专解骨蒸劳热，尤能泄暑热之火，泄火热而不耗气血，用之以佐气血之药，大建奇功，可君可臣，而又可佐可使，无不宜也。但必须多用，因其体既轻，而性兼补阴，少用转不得力。又青蒿之退阴火，退骨中之火也，然不独退骨中之火，即肌肤之火，未尝不共泻之也，故阴虚而又感邪者，最宜用耳。又青蒿最宜沙参、地骨皮共享，则泻阴火更捷，青蒿能引骨中之火，行于肌表，而沙参、地骨皮只能凉骨中之火，而不能外泄也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-1krs5xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-1krs5xq","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经逢原》：青蒿亦有两种，一种发于早春，叶青如绵茵陈，专泻丙丁之火，能利水道，与绵茵陈之性不甚相远；一种盛于夏秋，微黄似地肤子，为少阳、厥阴血分之药，茎紫者为良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-s1j4dzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-s1j4dzy","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《重庆堂随笔》：青蒿，专解湿热，而气芳香，故为湿温疫疠要药。又清肝、胆血分之伏热，故为女子淋带、小儿痉痫疳ＮＩ神剂，《本草》未言，特为发之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-xb619jd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-xb619jd","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《神农本草经》：主疥瘙痂痒，恶疮，杀虱，留热在骨节间，明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-bdb8mkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-bdb8mkg","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《唐本草》：生挼敷金疮，大止血，生肉，止疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-9wz7lvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-9wz7lvo","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《食疗本草》：益气，长发，补中，明目，煞风毒。治骨蒸。烧灰淋汁，和石灰煎，治恶疮瘢靥。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-8t834bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-8t834bn","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草拾遗》：主妇人血气，腹内满，及冷热久痢。秋冬用子，春夏用苗，并捣绞汁服。亦暴干为末，小便冲服。如觉冷，用酒煮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-31m9ntn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-31m9ntn","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《日华子本草》：长毛发，发黑不老，兼去蒜发，心痛热黄，生捣汁服并敷之。泻痢，饭饮调末五钱匕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-hzpy2ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-hzpy2ps","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《滇南本草》：去湿热，消痰。治痰火嘈杂眩晕。利小便，凉血，止大肠风热下血，退五种劳热，发烧怕冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-evqe3fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-evqe3fe","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草纲目》：治疟疾寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-xjpw1o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-xjpw1o3","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草新编》：退暑热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-o2kfdh1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-o2kfdh1","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《生草药性备要》：治小儿食积，洗疥癞。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-4qu8645","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-4qu8645","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14.《医林纂要》：清血中湿热，治黄疸及郁火不舒之证。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-7q26rkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-7q26rkp","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612184823-4396b4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184823-4396b4u","updated":"20240612184823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184825-kgfxmvm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184825-kgfxmvm"}},{"ID":"20240612184826-cl5dne3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184826-cl5dne3"}}]}